Pannotia-style single-source shortest path benchmark.

The input graph uses DIMACS shortest-path COO format:

  c comments are ignored
  p sp <num_nodes> <num_edges>
  a <from> <to> <weight>

The benchmark stores the graph in transpose CSR form and runs the Pannotia
min-plus relaxation kernel. The optional third command-line argument is the
zero-based source vertex. The default source is 0.
